2 Intel D5005 FPGAs<br>
2 NextSilicon coprocessors<br>
48 Intel Optane SSDs<br>
120 Intel GPU Max 1100<br>
</p></td></tr>
<tr>
</tr><tr class=3D"odd">
<td><p>Interconnect:</p></td>
<td><p>NVIDIA Mellanox NDR200 InfiniBand (MPI and storage)<br>
Liqid PCIe Gen4 Fabrics (composability)<br>
Liqid PCIe Gen5 Fabrics (composability)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"even">
<td><p>Peak Performance:</p></td>
<td><p>1.6 PFLOPS</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"odd">
